{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object in range, take it, check properties, move to a location and do specific task, otherwise randomly move.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject     /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible     /> <Action ID = MoveToLocation     /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInRange     /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties     /> <Action ID = RandomMove     /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask     /> <Action ID = ScanArea     />",
